{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1505093-dragons-with-inheritance-10-12","id":1505093,"title":"Dragons with Inheritance 10-12?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-11T01:31:16-08:00","id":1505093,"title":"Dragons with Inheritance 10-12?","content":"Hey everyone,<br /> <br /> recently read for the first time through the Dragon Rulebook as I need a ... godlike Dragon to teach some manners to some Demigods that think violence is always a very smart idea.<br /> <br /> I wanted to build him like I'd do an PC, but saw that they seemingly (?!) can only go up to 9 Inheritance? Is that correct or did I miss an information somewhere in the book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26156-avalontzi","name":"AvalonTzi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-11T03:46:07-08:00","id":1505100,"title":"","content":"You haven't missed anything (except, I think, that dragons can go up to Inheritance 10). Bear in mind, though, that <b>Scion: God</b> came after <b>Scion: Dragon</b>; so I'm not the least surprised that the latter didn't have anything in it concerning godlike dragons. It's also one of those edge cases that tends to crop up every now and again; and as such, it's the sort of thing that may never get an official resolution. If it does, though, I could see it being addressed in a companion book for <b>Scion: God</b>, or as a Tasty Bit. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://t